1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
To the ones we've lost along the way

2
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:06,500
Who fought it to the end

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:11,220
Passing never made you weak

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,580
It made you human, friend

5
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:17,940
And the strong ain't the ones who never fall

6
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:21,780
Or the ones who never cry

7
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:25,060
They're the ones who let you hold them

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,980
When it's time

9
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:30,420
To say goodbye

10
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,652
The strong survive

11
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:39,380
The strong was never steel

12
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:42,580
It's the hand that reaches out

13
00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:46,820
And the courage to be real

14
00:00:47,860 --> 00:00:48,540
So if you're hiding who you are behind a smile you've learned to wear
